 73		\]
 74	\end{lemma}
 75	\begin{proof}
 76		\leanok
 77		If $\beta=0$ the character is constant. If $\beta\ne 0$, the map $x \mapsto \beta x$ permutes $\F_q$, so the average is the average of a nontrivial additive character, which vanishes.
